WEBVTT

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.650
Ah! My Goddess
Flights of Fancy

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:23.180
In this wide world

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:28.360
People you're meant to meet can be seen

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:34.930
Beyond the window, beyond the rainbow

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:38.560
I think you're aware of them

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:45.680
Take off that restrictive weight

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.640
Let your feelings go

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:55.950
Now keep your ears open and wait for that time

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:58.720
Awaken now

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:12.000
Cherish the little dream you've
drawn in the vast sky

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.280
If you do, you can always become happy

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:22.040
It's certain

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:26.410
Woh woh

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:39.090
Japanese hot springs are so nice...

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:42.430
You got it. And this sake is great, too.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.930
That's all you ever care about, Urd!

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:47.070
Don't be so picky.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:50.530
I mean, it's been so long since the
three of us had a nice bath together.

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:55.930
And that's all thanks to Big Sister winning
us a free trip to the hot springs.

00:01:56.210 --> 00:01:59.050
What? I... don't know what you mean.

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:01.320
Then who was it?

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:02.550
Who knows?

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:07.620
Uh, well... no matter!

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:13.930
And by the way, Skuld, I noticed
you've GROWN a bit!

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:14.930
Whoa, no! Wait a minute, stop!
And by the way, Skuld, I noticed
you've GROWN a bit!

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:15.660
Whoa, no! Wait a minute, stop!

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:16.770
Whoa, no! Wait a minute, stop!
It's moments like this that make it
tough being a man...

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:19.630
It's moments like this that make it
tough being a man...

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:23.300
Huh?

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:26.600
What's a woman doing in the men's bath?!

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:28.670
Marller!

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:31.110
M-Morisato?

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:46.400
Ah! I'm Half Goddess, Half Demon?!

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:51.900
Are you okay, Keiichi?

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:55.760
Well, I guess I'll be all right...

00:02:56.310 --> 00:03:00.740
I can't believe a demon would scream like that
just over being seen naked by a human!

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:05.750
I couldn't help it! I never expected
to see the four of YOU here!

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:08.180
My dear, what lies ahead in life
is shrouded in darkness.

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:10.740
No one knows what light is to come
at the end of the tunnel!

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:14.820
Here I thought I'd be able to relax and enjoy
the hot spring... Way to screw things up!

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:16.360
Is that the truth, now?

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:18.790
So you aren't planning to pull another
nasty trick on us, are you?

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.400
I'm taking some personal time today.

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:22.230
I have no intention of getting
into it with you all.

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:24.630
Then how about a drink? It's been a while.

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:25.630
What?!

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:27.540
It's your day off, right?

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:30.700
We used to drink a lot back before
we both got into this line of work.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:33.640
Yeah, you're right.

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:35.230
Hey, hey, Marller...

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.880
So those two used to be close?

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:45.210
Yes. I'm sure they still are, too.

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.920
What a surprise! I'd never have guessed that!

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:54.130
I think there is a connection
between them after all.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:59.430
That reminds me of how you put
a bug in my drink one time.

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:01.570
Yeah, that's right!

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:05.230
It was in return for the poison you put
in my drink that other time.

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:11.010
Are you sure those two are close?

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:15.210
After that, we made up with each other
by exchanging flowers.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:18.680
Yeah, and we both put explosive grass
in the bouquets, didn't we?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:24.850
It looks like we'll have to
settle our score after all.

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:27.360
Yeah, it would seem so.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:31.070
Then why don't we do this?

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.460
What should we do?

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:38.410
As long as we're here, we'll forget about
being "goddesses" or "demons,"

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:42.010
and we won't get into any fights,
no matter what.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.040
And if anyone breaks this rule...

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.040
She'll be punished!

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:50.520
Just for acting like normal?

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.820
I'm getting kinda scared wondering
what the punishment could be...

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:54.690
Is that okay, then?

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:56.080
Okay.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:59.260
Okay, then let's all have some fun!

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:03.730
I used to go to the firing range every day

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:07.040
to shoot away the gloom I felt
when you defeated me.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.660
You'd be nuts to think you
could beat me NOW!

00:05:08.970 --> 00:05:11.310
Game Everyone’s Amusement
Target Practice

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:12.210
Game Everyone’s Amusement
Target Practice
Okay, next game!

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:12.670
Okay, next game!

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:18.910
Oh, too bad. You're about 205 million
points away from reality

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:21.720
if you think that kinda score is
enough to compete with ME.

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:22.840
Look!

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:28.960
I don't have time for stupid ass games
like this! If this is how it's gonna be...

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:32.190
Oh, are you saying you'd rather
settle things like THIS?

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:33.680
It would be a pleasure.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:41.440
I guess violence is out of
the question, though!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.940
After all, nothing ever comes
of meaningless fighting!

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.270
Y-Yeah, you're right!

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:48.110
How about we have a nice, fun
game of table tennis next?

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.310
Hey, there's always karaoke, y'know!

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:52.580
Well, now that you mention it,
there's always mahjong, too!

00:05:54.820 --> 00:05:57.340
Good grief, they've got a lot of energy...

00:05:57.650 --> 00:06:00.880
But Marller IS a lot more fun
than I had expected.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.890
Yes, she is.

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:11.490
Sahara

00:06:13.740 --> 00:06:14.740
Inaoka

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:17.640
Inaoka
I wonder when the next time
we drink together will be.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:19.780
Inaoka
We're going, Urd!

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:20.740
Inaoka
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:22.610
Ah, it's been a while since I've been
able to kick back and relax.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:23.610
Ah, I want the window seat, Big Sister!
Ah, it's been a while since I've been
