00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:08.000
What?!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.510
You're saying that she's been
captured by Marller?!

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.640
Probably...

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:15.340
How could she... Why, we just had a
lot of fun together the other day!

00:10:16.310 --> 00:10:17.340
Skuld!

00:10:18.010 --> 00:10:19.140
Banpei!

00:10:22.350 --> 00:10:24.410
Good grief, Urd, you're such a fool!

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.380
