separate my divine half from my demonic half.

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:35.160
Well, it just so happens that
I have obtained THIS.

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:36.260
Huh?

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:40.430
A legendary item which can split
and fuse personalities:

00:11:40.430 --> 00:11:42.230
