00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:46.070
Marller... where did you get that?

00:11:46.070 --> 00:11:48.040
From a hellish mail-order catalog!

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:51.870
I haven't seen you around before.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.880
Ah, well I'm new.

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:55.010
Is that right?

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:58.450
Huh? Hey, I never ordered this!

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:01.120
But, that's definitely what I've
got on the invoice here...

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:03.120
I guess so...

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:05.120
Well... we appreciate the business!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.020
What the heck IS this?

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:09.520
This is the legendary heretical pot,

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:13.200
which I can use to split and fuse
personalities however I please,

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:15.760
and which came mixed in with
a number of items

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:20.200
that I bought through a hellish
mail-order catalog!

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:23.870
See how fortune smiles upon me
for all the good I have done!

00:12:23.870 --> 00:12:26.070
Don't you use that cheesy
looking thing on me!

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:28.500
Commence transplant!

