00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:25.030
Urd! Where the heck have you gone?!

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:27.770
What are you doing here, Skuld?

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:28.570
Huh?!

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:29.960
Urd!

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:34.910
Don't you give me that!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:38.910
I thought Marller might have
sealed you away or something!

00:13:38.910 --> 00:13:42.010
