Is that what made you so angry?

00:14:04.470 --> 00:14:06.270
No, not a bit.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:09.210
I'm just sick of you, that's all.

00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:13.650
NO!

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:19.250
