human desires anyway.

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:46.310
So basically... as long as the goddesses
go home now, I'm good.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.250
You're naive, simple!

00:14:48.250 --> 00:14:49.350
What?!

00:14:49.350 --> 00:14:52.810
If increasing shares is what you want
to do, then take the whole world!

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:55.790
Th-The whole world?!

00:14:55.990 --> 00:15:00.290
Oh, how wonderful! A free world
without law and order!

00:15:00.530 --> 00:15:02.960
Truly a utopia for humanity!

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:04.690
And...

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:09.700
