00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:24.100
On the way back, I saw Banpei just
lying around, so I brought him home.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:26.680
I'll go search for her some more!

00:17:26.680 --> 00:17:28.440
Then I'll go, too!

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:31.710
