00:18:43.820 --> 00:18:47.990
So then I was sealed into the mirror
by your demonic half?

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:49.060
Yes...

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:52.960
Given how I was able to release
the seal with my own voice,

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:57.760
