just according to plan.

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:31.100
The rule of evil shall begin in
the most unlikely of places...

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.230
Oh!

00:19:32.900 --> 00:19:35.040
Couldn't you wait for the tea, could you?

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:38.810
